# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}{animal}{:else}no animals{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,5 @@
-{#each animals as animal}{animal}{:else}no animals{/each}
+{#each animals as animal}
+    {animal}
+{:else}
+    no animals
+{/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}
    {animal}
{:else}
    no animals
{/each}
```
